      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a heavy weight i can't carry. like, if things can't ever go back to normal, then what's the point in even struggling through the day? it feels so much more logical to just stop fighting something that isn't going to change. like it would be more peaceful to just let go of everything.",
